@startuml
title Student Attendance System - System Sequence Diagram
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor Lecturer
actor Student
participant "Student Attendance System" as System

note over Lecturer,System
System boundary: React frontend + Express API + MySQL.
Internal calls are intentionally hidden in this system sequence diagram.
Successful login and database availability are assumed after authentication.
end note

Lecturer -> System: Log in (staff ID, password)
System --> Lecturer: JWT (24 hours), lecturer profile and dashboard

opt Lecturer chooses mobile location setup
  Lecturer -> System: Request mobile setup (course, date, start/end time)
  System --> Lecturer: Setup QR link with request ID and token (5-minute expiry)
  Lecturer -> System: Open setup link on phone and submit location\n(request ID, token, latitude, longitude, accuracy)
  System --> Lecturer: Location accepted; request completed
  loop While desktop waits for the location
    Lecturer -> System: Check location request status
    System --> Lecturer: Status and submitted location when completed
  end
end

Lecturer -> System: Create session (course, date, start/end time, lecturer location)
alt Course not owned by lecturer or an active session already exists
  System --> Lecturer: Reject creation (403 ownership / 409 active session)
else Session created
  System --> Lecturer: Session details and attendance QR link\n(random token, 15-minute expiry, 50-meter allowed radius)
  opt Session used a completed mobile location request
    Lecturer -> System: Mark mobile location request used
    System --> Lecturer: Request marked used
  end

  Lecturer -> Student: Display attendance QR code
  Student -> System: Open QR link (session ID, QR token)
  opt Student is not signed in
    System --> Student: Request login; preserve QR destination
    Student -> System: Log in (student number, password)
    System --> Student: JWT and student profile; return to QR page
  end

  Student -> System: Mark attendance and permit browser location access
  alt Location unavailable, denied, or reported accuracy exceeds 50 meters
    System --> Student: Explain location issue; no attendance submission
  else Location acquired with acceptable reported accuracy
    note over Student,System
    Frontend submits session ID, QR token, latitude and longitude.
    API authenticates the JWT and requires the student role.
    end note
    alt Session/token invalid, closed or expired; lecturer location missing
      System --> Student: Reject attendance with session validation error
    else Student was not enrolled when the session was created
      System --> Student: Reject attendance (403)
    else Attendance already recorded for this student and session
      System --> Student: Reject duplicate attendance (400)
    else Calculated distance exceeds session radius
      System --> Student: Reject attendance (403), distance and allowed radius
    else All checks pass
      System --> Student: Attendance recorded (201), status present and distance
    end
  end

  Lecturer -> System: Request session attendance and summary
  System --> Lecturer: Attendance records and session statistics
  Lecturer -> System: Close session
  System --> Lecturer: Session closed; further attendance rejected
end
@enduml
